</em>, where a<sub>k</sub> and b<sub>k</sub> both are real. If N<sub>0</sub> is even, then <em>C</em><sub><em>N</em>0/2</sub> is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> Purely imaginary</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> Complex</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> Purely real</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> None</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (c)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/251e17771885e7162eaaa94bf35480f4b8c63c19.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":10,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>\n A causal LTI system has the frequency response <em>H</em>(ω) shown in figure. For the input <img src=\"/media/17ae1c296f516f43c263fb6dd289f282f3df471c.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> with Fourier Transform,</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/d27dbf0b2429285f1667ae0882013190b898d96b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n the filtered output signal y(t) is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/eb261ec1b737f660f01ef348dd70e79998ecd6b5.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/b0ff56e8590817aa0c688f34b6e9b05bcf46e221.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/4fb847a5a60a8d0eb358bdfdcf2590af11c9b398.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/fa4eb8c7c0ea9ceb334af0ce847414717b2cddbc.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (c)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/9dc23d01998406ee474a8f760bfee147061833eb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":11,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>\n Consider the system:</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/418f6bf9d367cb5c0d35695f86d8201a25242443.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p